{"id":"myvmffb5ezhurvt4zd3dk0frn","title":"Rust编译器在nightly渠道默认启用并行前端","originalTitle":"Enabling the parallel frontend on nightly","summary":"Rust团队在nightly渠道默认启用并行前端以收集反馈，测试显示8线程时编译速度提升44%（如nalgebra项目），但实际效果受CPU核心数影响。用户可通过--jobs-frontend=8调整线程数，但高线程可能增加内存占用。当前主要解决并行稳定性问题，后续计划优化AST转换等模块的并行支持。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://blog.rust-lang.org/2026/11/16/enabling-parallel-frontend-on-nightly/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T15:22:38.857Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-16T16:59:33.262Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-16T16:59:33.262Z","category":"languages-runtime","tags":["版本发布","性能提升","技术方案","Rust"],"score":56,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"de273dff-008a-49ec-9efc-dec5986c4612","title":"Rust编译器nightly默认启用并行前端，测试显示8线程加速44%"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"de273dff-008a-49ec-9efc-dec5986c4612","title":"Rust编译器nightly默认启用并行前端，测试显示8线程加速44%"}],"topics":[{"slug":"rust","name":"Rust"},{"slug":"major-release","name":"重大版本发布"},{"slug":"performance","name":"性能与基准"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fUx1Q3u7oHDg","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}